  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2447,
      "text": "This is how We relate to you [O Prophet] from the stories of the past, and We have given you a Reminder[33] from Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 274,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2448,
      "text": "Whoever turns away from it will bear a heavy burden on the Day of Resurrection,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 274,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2449,
      "text": "abiding therein forever[34]. What a terrible burden they will carry on the Day of Resurrection!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 274,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2450,
      "text": "the Day when the Trumpet will be blown; on that Day We will gather together the wicked sightless[35] [from horror].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 274,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2451,
      "text": "They will whisper to one another, “You stayed no more than ten days [on earth].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 274,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2452,
      "text": "We know best what they will say – the most discerning among them will say, “You stayed no more than a day.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 104,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 274,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2453,
      "text": "They ask you about the mountains, say, “My Lord will scatter them into dust,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 105,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2454,
      "text": "and He will leave the earth level and plain,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2455,
      "text": "you will not see therein any troughs or peaks.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2456,
      "text": "On that day, they will follow the summoner[36]; none will dare to deviate. All voices will be hushed in awe before the Most Compassionate; you will hear nothing except a whisper[37].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 108,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2457,
      "text": "On that day, no intercession will be of any use except to whom the Most Compassionate gave permission and approved his word.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 109,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2458,
      "text": "He knows all that is ahead of them and all that is behind them[38], but they do not encompass it[39] with their knowledge.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 110,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 127,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2459,
      "text": "All faces will be humbled before the Ever-Living, Self-Sustaining. Those burdened with wrongdoing[40] will be in a total loss.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 111,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 128,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2460,
      "text": "But whoever does righteous deeds, being a believer, will have no fear of being wronged or deprived.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 112,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 319,
      "ruku": 275,
      "hizbQuarter": 128,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2461,
      "text": "We have sent it down as an Arabic Qur’an and diversified its warnings, so that they may fear Allah or it may cause them to take heed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
